{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_12","type":"agent_message","text":"The original condition is now stored without adding or deleting fields, and decoding compares the witness without calling it. The identity fix covers selected operations, though; I’m checking the remaining observation paths and whether cell mutation can change what an unchanged rethrow forwards."}}
