{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_31","type":"agent_message","text":"The cell probes expose a provenance gap: copying all three slots into a guest-created cell is accepted as a retained exception. Copying another genuine wrapper’s contents into the original cell also makes `(throw e)` forward the other condition. The witness protects the contents, but it does not bind them to the wrapper’s identity or keep that association private."}}
